      ],
      "data": {
        "text": "Two video oscillators are mixed with the Bus Mixer in Difference mode. Where the two patterns disagree you see moire stripes.\nThe Colorizer paints the grey stripes with colour.\nSlow LFOs move the stripe frequencies and shift the colours, so the picture never stops flowing.\nTry the MIX knob and the blend MODE on the Bus Mixer.\nTry the FREQ knobs on the oscillators and the HUE knobs on the Colorizer."
      }
    }
